cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Mount Kenya Fire Analysis (mtkenya-fire)"
abstract: >-
  Replay, analysis and planning tool for wildfire on Mount Kenya: Sentinel-2
  burn mapping and NASA FIRMS hotspots of the September 2026 moorland fire, a
  calibrated fire-spread model, and a 3D what-if and live simulator with
  firefighting resources.
authors:
  - name: "The mtkenya-fire contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dom-inic/mtkenya-fire"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - Mount Kenya
  - remote sensing
  - Sentinel-2
  - FIRMS
  - fire spread model
